  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UN Joint Project for SAFE Access to Fuel and Energy in Cox&apos;sBazar</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UN Joint Project to address cooking fuel needs, environmental degradation and food security for populations affected by the Rohinya Refugee crisis. It aims to address short, medium and longer-term challenges with activities benefitting both the refugee and the host community populations, and contributing to social cohesion.
International Organization for Migration (IOM) will execute the Project, in cooperation with UN Food and Agricultural Organization (FAO) and World Food Programme (WFP).</narrative>
  </description>
